WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.941
Now choose where your requests run.

2
00:00:03.941 --> 00:00:05.360
Auto is recommended.

3
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.773
Each request goes to the best fit.

4
00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:12.810
That's one of your machines when it has a capable model, which is free.

5
00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.442
Otherwise, the network.

6
00:00:15.442 --> 00:00:17.931
Local first tries this computer.

7
00:00:17.931 --> 00:00:19.876
Then your other machines.

8
00:00:19.876 --> 00:00:21.198
Then the network.

9
00:00:22.198 --> 00:00:26.940
This computer only, and My machines only, never use the network.

10
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:27.903
They're free.

11
00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:31.399
Or always use one model that you pick.

12
00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:35.549
Code and bots need models that can use tools.

13
00:00:35.549 --> 00:00:37.719
The app only offers them those.

14
00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:42.436
You can also add your own frontier key in the desktop app.

15
00:00:42.436 --> 00:00:45.896
Only your account uses it, and the provider bills you.

16
00:00:46.896 --> 00:00:48.645
Pick one, then press Next.
